      "id": "claim_df332e4589a741cfa18e49fe2c74bc2c",
      "statement": "`/effort` is a visible Talon chat command advertised with `/help` and platform command registries; it reports or sets reasoning effort for the current model across chats and accepts a supported level or `default`.",
