    {
      "id": "claim_d934cb026d0948aeb33cee3d329a9e62",
      "statement": "Talon resolves reasoning controls through a model-specific allowlist: it uses shared profile metadata and documented fallbacks, recognizes DeepSeek, Qwen, and GLM families, normalizes `extra-high` and `x_high` to `xhigh`, and rejects a requested setting not allowed for the selected model.",
